/* Experiment 204 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, holdout A for Problem 9 (Maxima column).
   Every case is the argmax/argmin of a black-box numerical integral.
   Maxima's only numerical optimiser, lbfgs, differentiates its objective
   SYMBOLICALLY, so it cannot take a quad_qag* value as the objective, and
   there is no derivative-free optimiser (as in experiment 174): all rows SKIP.
   See parametric_extremum.m. */
load("../harness.mac")$
load("../siam100_common.mac")$
for k : 1 thru 10 do (
  skip(sconcat("hc9.", k, " machine"), "black-box numeric optimiser"),
  skip(sconcat("hc9.", k, " wp50"), "black-box numeric optimiser"))$
quit()$
